{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19533","headline":"和张相公太原山亭怀古诗 · 韩察","name":"和张相公太原山亭怀古诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公府政多暇，思与仁智全。\n爲山想岩穴，引水听潺湲。\n轩冕迹自逸，尘俗无由牵。\n苍生方瞩望，讵得赋归田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}